WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:04.940
Claim, prove, verify and complete a task

2
00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:07.220
with the SpecWeave CLI.

3
00:00:07.270 --> 00:00:10.981
Start with specweave task claim T-01.

4
00:00:10.981 --> 00:00:14.176
The claim goes into the ledger as claude@demo,

5
00:00:14.176 --> 00:00:16.434
so others see who owns the task.

6
00:00:16.434 --> 00:00:20.410
It prints the acceptance criteria, the files and the test.

7
00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:22.173
With the change committed,

8
00:00:22.173 --> 00:00:26.366
task done --run runs the test again.

9
00:00:26.366 --> 00:00:29.514
Only a zero exit marks the task done,

10
00:00:29.514 --> 00:00:31.240
with the output as evidence.

11
00:00:31.290 --> 00:00:36.795
The full output is saved in reports/task-T-01.txt:

12
00:00:36.795 --> 00:00:41.670
the command, its exit code and the time, then the test results.

13
00:00:41.720 --> 00:00:45.597
Now try to close the increment with specweave complete.

14
00:00:45.597 --> 00:00:50.144
It refuses: reports/verify.json is missing,

15
00:00:50.144 --> 00:00:53.580
so it tells you to run specweave verify first.

16
00:00:53.630 --> 00:00:58.409
specweave verify runs the project's test, lint and build scripts,

17
00:00:58.409 --> 00:01:01.120
here only npm run test.

18
00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:03.582
Both acceptance criteria are met,

19
00:01:03.582 --> 00:01:06.130
because the task that covers them is done.

20
00:01:06.180 --> 00:01:10.620
Its report, verify.md, keeps the test output,

21
00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:13.975
the criteria table, and the task with its evidence.

22
00:01:13.975 --> 00:01:18.480
verify.json beside it is what complete reads.

23
00:01:18.530 --> 00:01:20.678
Run specweave complete again.

24
00:01:20.678 --> 00:01:24.430
The verify check passes, and the increment is completed.

25
00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:29.040
Next, hand the work to another agent with specweave handoff.
